#X text 320 480 Inlets: left - right - gain - ceiling - release. Both sides - after Gain - are multiplied by ceiling / peak - where the peak is that of the louder side - held and let go in Release (ge-peak) - and never counted as less than the ceiling. The peak is never below the signal - so the output is never above the ceiling.;
